title: "Importing an issue that local items already reference by gh: tag creates a second, unlinked record: link them instead of leaving apparent duplicates"
description: "GH issue #296: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/issues/296 · author @unbraind · created 2026-11-27T10:45:14Z · updated 2026-11-27T11:24:24Z"
